status.title:
filter based on the object status.
Need to pass the string value of the status field of the object ( backup /restore )
For example, {"Success", "Failed"}

endpoint.description:
S3 endpoint URL.
For AWS Workload Identity (use_workload_identity=true on AWS): ignored;
 the AWS SDK derives the regional endpoint from the region.

disable_ssl.description:
Disable TLS for S3 traffic (used with HTTP-only S3-compatible stores).
For AWS Workload Identity (use_workload_identity=true on AWS): ignored;
 TLS is always enforced.
